WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:11.400
In this lesson, you will learn to make a character say something with a speech-bubble block, at the right moment in a script.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.843
The say block makes a speech bubble.

3
00:00:15.843 --> 00:00:20.557
Type the words you want your character to say.

4
00:00:21.157 --> 00:00:31.087
Put the say block where you want the talking to happen: at the start, in the middle or at the end.

5
00:00:31.687 --> 00:00:38.139
A character can say “Hi!” at the start and “Bye!” at the end.

6
00:00:38.739 --> 00:00:45.626
In ScratchJr you can also record your own voice with the green sound block.

7
00:00:46.226 --> 00:00:50.070
Walk to the star, THEN say “Hello!”.

8
00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:53.478
The cat walked, then said hello!

9
00:00:54.078 --> 00:00:57.922
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

10
00:00:57.922 --> 00:01:03.070
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
